FontTools 4.61.1
https://github.com/fonttools/fonttools/tree/4.61.1

The numeric Unicode intervals and OpenType OS/2 range-bit assignments in
lib/src/fonts/font_subsetter.dart were transcribed from OS2_UNICODE_RANGES in
Lib/fontTools/ttLib/tables/O_S_2f_2.py. These are specification facts from the
OpenType OS/2 Unicode-range table. The transcription sorts the intervals,
omits names, and handles the supplementary-plane flag separately.

The FontTools copyright and license are preserved below as a precaution for
derived data. FontTools is not a Quds runtime dependency. Its license was
verified against the installed 4.61.1 distribution and the tagged source:
https://github.com/fonttools/fonttools/blob/4.61.1/LICENSE

